OL,3,GNEWSACity rally after firework campaign
OL,4,Agets PM backing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners behind a long-running drive
OL,7,Fagainst the anti-social use of
OL,8,Ffireworks in Bradford have appealed to
OL,9,Fthe community to join them because "we
OL,10,Fno longer want our city to be known for
OL,11,Ffireworks nuisance".
OL,13,FThe plea came after Andy Burnham said
OL,14,Fthere was "a case for going further on
OL,15,Ffireworks and regulating them" during
OL,16,Fhis first Prime Minister's Questions on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
