OL,3,GNEWSACity rally after firework campaign
OL,4,Agets PM backing
OL,5,
OL,6,FInayah Sher, who has campaigned on the
OL,7,Fissue for almost a decade, said hearing
OL,8,Fthe prime minister discuss fireworks in
OL,9,FParliament had given her "a real sense
OL,10,Fof relief" and renewed hope that
OL,11,Ftougher action could soon follow.
OL,13,FCampaigners plan to hold a
OL,14,Fdemonstration on 12 September in the
OL,15,Fcity centre as part of their push.
